    "$t": "海產新思潮"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蔡文莉</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj4JDARDvB_OXkU0S1DvfzC9rTmekY-2EyfMsb9iOUx3UmMRUlMqC_mOQUhrM2cnK_AZeYJpeC-ZeLyWksIdVMDJC-btGKqtvfSXib2frPoyhPO6rUCQ-PW2i1sjqcAKI9dfsVQyj2MtA1bGNdu5l7NMLod6QyT68qfs8-9wYwoqib91ii79sYIwfyBgA/s2363/20020814%20%E6%95%A3%E6%96%87%20%EF%BC%88%E7%9F%AD%E6%96%87%EF%BC%89%E8%94%A1%E6%96%87%E8%8E%89%20%E6%B5%B7%E7%94%A2%E6%96%B0%E6%80%9D%E6%BD%AE.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1775\" data-original-width=\"2363\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj4JDARDvB_OXkU0S1DvfzC9rTmekY-2EyfMsb9iOUx3UmMRUlMqC_mOQUhrM2cnK_AZeYJpeC-ZeLyWksIdVMDJC-btGKqtvfSXib2frPoyhPO6rUCQ-PW2i1sjqcAKI9dfsVQyj2MtA1bGNdu5l7NMLod6QyT68qfs8-9wYwoqib91ii79sYIwfyBgA/w640-h480/20020814%20%E6%95%A3%E6%96%87%20%EF%BC%88%E7%9F%AD%E6%96%87%EF%BC%89%E8%94%A1%E6%96%87%E8%8E%89%20%E6%B5%B7%E7%94%A2%E6%96%B0%E6%80%9D%E6%BD%AE.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">舊年（2022年）『洄遊吧』kah農委會合辦12場海產教育（食魚教育）系列講座，阮參加第三場，去嘉義布袋參觀邱--家兄弟ê虱目仔池。Tse是阮頭一回看著魚池邊--a有大樹！除了雨傘樹（『小葉欖仁』）是頭家種--ê，大部份lóng家己發--ê。池仔墘發草，頭家堅持一冬khai 2、30萬tshiànn人phut草；kah除草劑三萬有找sio比，池仔墘青lìng-lìng兼顧水質，ē和。有專門ê水窟仔sîn雨水，用天然ê tsiánn水，就免抽地下水。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">虱目仔生成是「洄游性」--ê，飼khah少--leh，留khah大位hōo伊pha-pha走，mā留位飼khang-khuè魚來改善水質，請in tàu piànn魚池仔。Khang-khuè魚有幾若種。親像虱目仔池，虱目仔是飼來賣，大頭鰱、蝦仔、鯽仔魚……lóng是khang-khuè魚。 親像草魚，tàu食池仔墘草。大頭鰱、蝦仔食池仔海草，蝦仔，koh ē piànn魚屎。鯽仔魚、豆仔魚khîng飼料，就免煩惱飼料食賰，tī池仔內底生菌。筍殼魚蹛水窟仔底，食tsho--ê，ē kā破病iah是bē大--ê魚仔食--去。Tsiah濟khang-khuè魚tàu piànn厝，虱目仔bē輸蹛別莊--leh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo魚仔食ê飼料內底ē摻動物性卵白質。負責kap飼料（kā幾若種配方kap-kap做伙）ê辛勞講，in是用lán人無愛食ê下跤料，親像虱目仔頭，人khah無愛食，就絞絞--leh飼塗虱，m̄是掠魚來飼魚。邱--家兄弟網站有介紹in ê理念kah故事，有興趣koh-khah了解--ê，歡迎去in網站se̍h-se̍h--leh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div><br /></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>邱--家兄弟，圖說生態養殖：<a href=\"https://www.chiubrothers.net/pages/chiubrothers-ecology-aqatic-products-5\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.chiubrothers.net/pages/chiubrothers-ecology-aqatic-products-5</a></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7frCeXv4T5DZNAiwIDvXSRu4xXYtneCudDFsSo1O5oN9pEH37mYDQy3v6za31x5BRmQz_9kyf1B-H3tE3dY4B-AGSq-r7onxoUjVktEnm1usTkLJQet4Gkwf_EVFdaN8p7xYZ6J0v6DFJxsQ2M6OzBByPBdO9ealKOdztaQ51nCOOmtchN15dVJ9DBQ/s1424/349%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7frCeXv4T5DZNAiwIDvXSRu4xXYtneCudDFsSo1O5oN9pEH37mYDQy3v6za31x5BRmQz_9kyf1B-H3tE3dY4B-AGSq-r7onxoUjVktEnm1usTkLJQet4Gkwf_EVFdaN8p7xYZ6J0v6DFJxsQ2M6OzBByPBdO9ealKOdztaQ51nCOOmtchN15dVJ9DBQ/w450-h640/349%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7UwDFda89m6FJ4ghZlo5kJ1ulgmVTLC7fHbzjfECRRIQ2CBypgdbwOVsfiZKbDxPQ89Xr9gzg7ZqoW0i65ZFEImxvN3lD7pYMNx8Jhr82l8BTwD0V791givQJkp55j2eQIWiw2YefiLDVch3uvPHuqS3DEzu50syqtO8Y8dmLGl7XWfA-Zd2VrJpbeQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8117.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7UwDFda89m6FJ4ghZlo5kJ1ulgmVTLC7fHbzjfECRRIQ2CBypgdbwOVsfiZKbDxPQ89Xr9gzg7ZqoW0i65ZFEImxvN3lD7pYMNx8Jhr82l8BTwD0V791givQJkp55j2eQIWiw2YefiLDVch3uvPHuqS3DEzu50syqtO8Y8dmLGl7XWfA-Zd2VrJpbeQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8117.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>Lán來講看māi&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h es